Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The End
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.00,0:00:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,North latitude 28 degrees 24 minutes,\Nwest longitude 80 degrees 36 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.44,0:00:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Go there, and wait patiently\Nfor the next new moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.12,0:00:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And that place is at Cape Canaveral\NSpace Center, to be precise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.22,0:00:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The time is the new moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.70,0:00:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Six days from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.76,0:00:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's face the facts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.00,0:00:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,My old man would never\Nlet that priest get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.46,0:00:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Jolene Keicho.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.42,0:00:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's up to me to seal what\Nthat bastard just obtained.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.42,0:00:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a prison break, and we're\Nabout to leave any minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.32,0:00:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I think you gotta take me with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.22,0:01:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So we're finally saying\Nadios to the aquarium, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.92,0:01:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought this place was horrendous\Nwhen I first got locked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.28,0:01:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But now that I look back...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.58,0:01:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.00,0:01:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It really was a shithole.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.54,0:01:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is the gas station.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.52,0:01:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And this is the bus stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.60,0:01:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we going to be taking the bus here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.94,0:01:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never actually been on one before.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.28,0:01:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You realize we're escaped convicts, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.64,0:01:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get caught the second\Nwe set foot on the bus yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.68,0:01:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,but if we're going after\Nthe priest There's no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.34,0:01:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be able to catch up to him on foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.06,0:01:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We know we just have to find another way
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.40,0:01:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This is me. Guess mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.44,0:02:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.00,0:02:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.82,0:02:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,much for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.30,0:02:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,As you can't see,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.48,0:03:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to turn on the light of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.64,0:03:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Or in her cell I can feel it in the\Nair she's finally free. My guess
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.00,0:03:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,is she pulled off a prison break
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.62,0:03:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,hey
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.50,0:03:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,hang on a
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.38,0:03:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,birthmark shaped like a
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.42,0:03:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Star. Hmm. Who the hell are you? I've
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.66,0:03:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,seen that star-shaped birthmark
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.22,0:03:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,somewhere before in the same place\Non the back of the green baby's neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.22,0:03:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And supposedly, Jolene's\Nfather bears a mark
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.50,0:03:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,that shares the same shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.84,0:04:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd better think hard\Nif you can't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.02,0:04:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,How exactly did you end\Nup at Green Dolphin?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.90,0:04:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you have no memory, does\Nthat mean it's safe to assume
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.04,0:04:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,that the priest extracted your\Nmemory disk like all the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.84,0:04:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He's my enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.16,0:04:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all that I can tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.22,0:04:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to learn the truth, so I'm\Nbreaking out of here to find and end him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.44,0:04:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What will you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.92,0:04:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This just in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.28,0:04:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Two convicts have broken\Nout of Green Dolphin
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.42,0:04:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Street State Prison and\Nare currently on the run.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.96,0:04:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The escaped convicts are Jolene\NCujo and Hermes Costello.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.80,0:04:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Photos of the two have been\Nreleased to the public.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.08,0:04:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Please contact us with any information.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.48,0:04:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.39,0:04:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,it sounds as though you've defeated Mew\NMew Stand and you're intent on finding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.24,0:04:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.15,0:04:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd the car stop moving?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.30,0:04:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,There's still plenty of gas in the tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.92,0:05:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Something like this has never happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.08,0:05:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I always take care of my vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.44,0:05:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got some bad news, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.56,0:05:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This is as far as I can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.10,0:05:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.20,0:05:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Please let Let me call\Nanother cab for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.60,0:05:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, but there is no need.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.22,0:05:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not in any hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.32,0:05:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a week until I'm born anew, and\NI'm still in terrible physical condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.50,0:05:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Just five more days until the new moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.42,0:05:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I can wait it out in this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.10,0:05:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll need to keep Jolene and\Nher friends away at all costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.96,0:05:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.87,0:05:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,He's going into cardiac arrest!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.46,0:05:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This burglar was shot in\Nthe leg by an officer,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.40,0:05:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,then proceeded to jump off\Nthe sixth floor of a building!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.80,0:06:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got a biker punk over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.62,0:06:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He drove against the floor of traffic\Nand slammed into the median strip!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.96,0:06:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.36,0:06:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This drug addict is going into shock!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.80,0:06:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.46,0:06:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay back or the priest gets it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.26,0:06:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful, the druggies\Nawake and out of control!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.50,0:06:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.41,0:06:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,He cut me with those scissors!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.72,0:06:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you point those fucking guns at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.78,0:06:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.32,0:06:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,There ain't no way in hell\NI'm gonna let you lock me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.78,0:07:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Requesting backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.94,0:07:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a hostage\Nsituation at the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.44,0:07:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, shit for brains!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.08,0:07:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell did you just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.70,0:07:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid, or do\Nyou want this guy to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.94,0:07:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You really pissed me off now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.04,0:07:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This fucking stone is about\Nto get stabbed because of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.98,0:07:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Earlier tonight, I saw shooting\Nstars in the sky above.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.94,0:07:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Three to be precise.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.32,0:07:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Just three, clearly\Nstreaking across the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.24,0:07:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,May I ask where you came from?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.64,0:07:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you three have any idea\Nwho it is you truly are?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.40,0:07:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.31,0:07:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The psycho stabbed him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.36,0:07:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec, that wasn't me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.16,0:07:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.22,0:07:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,However, if you were to move\Nthis blade another millimeter,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.48,0:07:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,it would certainly sever\Na vital nerve in my neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.66,0:07:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.40,0:07:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortunately, this stab wound\Ndoes not appear to be fatal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.04,0:07:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What will you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.16,0:07:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.48,0:08:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to move the\Nscissors a bit or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.74,0:08:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But first, answer me this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.68,0:08:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you believe in gravity?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.28,0:08:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think there is a force that\Ndraws certain individuals together?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.32,0:08:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Personally, this moment\Nhas made me a believer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.04,0:08:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,However, you are not\Ncapable of killing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.40,0:08:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You're here because my\Ngravitational pull led you to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.04,0:08:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you see that you shouldn't be\Nwasting your energy on useless drugs?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.10,0:08:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you should be using your\Nenergy on something much wiser.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.80,0:08:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuck this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.34,0:08:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,From the looks of things, where it\Npertains to who your father really is,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.10,0:08:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The three of you were left in the dark,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.54,0:08:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,but that won't last much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.92,0:08:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that we've been brought together, you\Nwill understand everything soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.90,0:09:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.82,0:09:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.90,0:09:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to bother you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.48,0:09:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This is nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.72,0:09:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Just an old knee injury\Nfrom my carpentry days.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.80,0:09:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,When it rains, my joints start to twinge.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.46,0:09:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,When it rains, your knee hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.08,0:09:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure does.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.99,0:09:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for showing me some kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.46,0:09:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop getting into random\Nstranger's business, Weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.16,0:09:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We're still fugitives, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.52,0:09:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Our faces are blasted all over the news.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.80,0:09:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The geezer might report us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.62,0:09:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Our best bet is to steal a car and\Nget the hell out of Dodge immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.86,0:09:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No stolen cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.14,0:10:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be too easy for them to track us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.00,0:10:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And then we'll never lose them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.62,0:10:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Chasing the priest\Nwould become impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.98,0:10:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not suggesting we\Ntake the bus, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.48,0:10:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,How long are we supposed to\Nwait till the next one comes?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.14,0:10:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, fellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.20,0:10:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'm gonna take in the bus?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.18,0:10:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't be here for another hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.78,0:10:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,How about I give you\Nboys a ride on my truck?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.30,0:10:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll have to hop in the back, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.54,0:10:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's because you\Nwere so kind to me earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.30,0:10:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm feeling better than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.54,0:10:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The pain on my knees was awful moments\Nago, but it's miraculously gone. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.56,0:10:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The sky feels so refreshing, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.80,0:10:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather forecast.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.96,0:10:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Call it luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.28,0:10:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We should take his offer, Anastasia.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.82,0:11:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So how's Jolene getting around right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.86,0:11:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,She is still safe, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.82,0:11:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene is currently heading north.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.24,0:11:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Of that, I'm certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.48,0:11:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,At any rate, we need to\Nbe heading north as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.98,0:11:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a famous theme\Npark in the city up north.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.88,0:11:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You ever been there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.52,0:11:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.30,0:11:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, at this theme park, the\Nmascot's a really famous character.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.60,0:11:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you might even know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.74,0:11:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,This guidebook is a total piece of crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.32,0:11:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't even show any of\Nthe famous characters in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.14,0:12:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey something's running around back here
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.54,0:12:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,could it be an enemy\Ndive or drive i got it
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.06,0:12:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure i still see something darting\Naround yeah well i got this one for sure
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.54,0:12:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But what the hell is this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.20,0:12:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond the alert weather forecast\Nthe stand user must be somewhere
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.60,0:12:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There's zero chance this old man's\Nthe stand user there's no reason
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.70,0:12:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,to show up the way he did He could\Nhave just attacked us from anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.20,0:12:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's not him, it must be\Nsomeone else in the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.06,0:12:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like you're able to\Nsense where Jolene is going.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.52,0:12:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe the priest can\Nsense us getting closer
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.02,0:12:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,and is sending his lackeys to\Nstop us from getting to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.72,0:12:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Now who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.06,0:12:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell us!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.97,0:12:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You really shouldn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.40,0:12:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stop choking me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.68,0:13:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.59,0:13:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to make children\Nall over the world very sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.08,0:13:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.86,0:13:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,For real though, they can't breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.10,0:13:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, give it a rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.48,0:13:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously, man, I'm begging you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.84,0:13:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,There's another little bastard\Nhiding on this truck, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.52,0:13:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you two working together?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.60,0:13:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, nuh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.88,0:13:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I work alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.80,0:13:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,My bad, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.08,0:13:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.48,0:13:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear it wasn't on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.30,0:13:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You son of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.58,0:13:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, my nose just\Ngrows on its own sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.58,0:13:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, it's sort of like a reflex.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.98,0:13:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,See, whenever I tell a lie, my\Nnose gets all long and junk.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.92,0:13:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And I just lied straight to your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.34,0:13:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But what I told you wasn't exactly\Na complete lie. So basically,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.92,0:13:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I might not be working with somebody,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.64,0:13:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,but that doesn't mean that\NI'm alone necessarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.46,0:13:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.78,0:13:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.69,0:13:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.66,0:13:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This proves I'm not lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.18,0:14:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You believe me now, right?\NOw! Shit! What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.28,0:14:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't I say to stop being so violent?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.86,0:14:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels kind of weird saying this about\Nmyself, but I think I'm a pretty good guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.40,0:14:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm definitely nice to children, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.10,0:14:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I might have been your\Nfriend when you were younger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.90,0:14:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.46,0:14:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of friends, I think the seven\Nof them are hiding around here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.44,0:14:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw three of the seven\Nguys a minute ago. See?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.88,0:14:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's been snacking\Non that apple over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.56,0:14:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Weather, you seeing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.40,0:14:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What the fuck is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.18,0:14:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Just so you know, that\Napple isn't poisonous!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.78,0:14:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.08,0:14:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but the one Snow\NWhite ate was poisonous.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.72,0:14:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No, she didn't actually eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.28,0:14:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,She choked on a piece of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.78,0:14:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So technically, she didn't digest it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.40,0:14:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But I mean, who'd eat an apple\Nfrom an old lady they didn't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.32,0:14:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Even on Valentine's Day, we're careful\Nabout the chocolates we put in our mouths.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.06,0:14:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Although it's that\Ncarelessness of hers that
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.74,0:15:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,makes you want to protect\Nher with your whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.76,0:15:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy shit, how many of you are there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.40,0:15:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got some more company with her!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.42,0:15:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Chill, chill, there's nothing\Nto panic about here, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.24,0:15:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Who were you a fan of when you were a kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.38,0:15:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, who's your favorite character?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.64,0:15:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it was little old me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.50,0:15:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Personally, I've got a thing\Nfor the Terminator T-1000.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.42,0:15:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy ain't on the truck, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.86,0:15:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Me and my bro like Chewbacca.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.92,0:15:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And the Elephant Man, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.66,0:15:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But no matter what, our Princess Snow\NWhite is the best character ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.30,0:15:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.70,0:15:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We know all the rumors about us?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.54,0:15:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Like how we like to sneak\Ninto a girl's panties!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.54,0:15:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,and do dirty things to\Nher, but they're lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.92,0:15:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Our relationship's\Nplatonic all the way. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.48,0:15:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,These, these guys are,\Nthey're so familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.20,0:15:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I know them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.52,0:15:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I know what they are,\Nbut what the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.26,0:15:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We have breaking news.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.36,0:16:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Today at 1.30 PM, Batman suddenly\Ndisappeared from all over the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.38,0:16:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I repeat, the beloved Batman is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.54,0:16:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Paintings and prints of him\Nhave also faded and we're
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.76,0:16:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,currently investigating the\Ncause of this phenomenon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.30,0:16:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We've received several reports of other\Nfamous characters vanishing as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.24,0:16:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear that, Weather?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.80,0:16:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Are these little freaks\Nwho I think they are?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.50,0:16:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Does this mean they've\Nbeen brought to life?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.66,0:16:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.57,0:16:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.10,0:16:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, who are you a fan of?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.34,0:16:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.92,0:16:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I don't know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.48,0:16:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go away, or I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.06,0:16:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell, Weather?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.54,0:16:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you really just take my stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.36,0:16:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I was in the middle of\Nreading that, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.42,0:16:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.28,0:16:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you, Anastasia?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.70,0:16:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Anastasia, where'd you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.76,0:16:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, old man, stop the truck!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.18,0:17:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.10,0:17:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.16,0:17:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I said pull over!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.72,0:17:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, damn, that ain't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.20,0:17:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's bad. Good heavens! You guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.02,0:17:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop the damn truck rips!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.58,0:17:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you hear me say stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.58,0:17:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.54,0:17:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on? Weather!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.52,0:17:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.60,0:17:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.32,0:17:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a body being dragged\Nunderneath the truck, and it's mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.24,0:17:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What the fuck is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.70,0:17:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is my body down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.28,0:17:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you've been separated, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.46,0:17:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But anyway, you used to like\Nme a long time ago, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.16,0:17:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you were a fan. No! Ah, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.16,0:17:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, it'll get\Ncaught in the tires.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.70,0:17:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Weather, make him stop the truck!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.10,0:17:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, could he be?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.14,0:18:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, goddammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.36,0:18:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna crash!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.86,0:18:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I made an airbag with weather forecast.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.74,0:18:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.28,0:18:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you manage to fall\Nout of the truck so suddenly?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.52,0:18:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure this is\Na stand user's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.46,0:18:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But I have no idea why you were\Nthe only one who was targeted.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.92,0:18:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If I were to wager a guess,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.42,0:18:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd say it has something to do with\Nmy ignorance of these characters.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.62,0:18:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be the reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.74,0:18:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Weather!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.24,0:18:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Did the wreck damage your eyes\Nor can you just not see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.96,0:18:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And is that my body\Nthat's limp in your arms?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.40,0:18:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone okay? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.50,0:18:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But where's the princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.92,0:18:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she okay too?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.94,0:18:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,She flew out of the truck and got\Nthrown towards that burger shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.56,0:18:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Hooper!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.60,0:18:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.80,0:19:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Anybody know those guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.02,0:19:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I know them, but it ain't like\NI'm friends with them or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.50,0:19:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,They're Japanese.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.50,0:19:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They've got some cool designs,\Nbut they're totally overrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.28,0:19:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The characters from stories and\Ncomics are brought into reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.84,0:19:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And in addition to that,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.50,0:19:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,this stand has the ability to separate\Nsomeone's soul from their body.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.16,0:19:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the secret behind the stand, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.32,0:19:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me, Pinocchio!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.56,0:19:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If you fantasy fucks or stands,\Nthen where's the stand user?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.68,0:19:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.59,0:19:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.62,0:19:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I honestly have no idea what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.18,0:19:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I'm just Pinocchio.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.04,0:19:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But why does something\Nlike that even matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.32,0:19:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You could live your life as a\Nhero in the fantasy world, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.50,0:19:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The possibilities are endless.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.88,0:19:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Your soul split from your body because\Nthat's what you truly wished would happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.54,0:19:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the realm where\Neveryone wishes to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.98,0:19:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Bohemian ecstatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.34,0:19:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Home of the Rhapsody of Freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.26,0:19:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Just shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.46,0:19:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If you refuse to answer my question,\NI'll resort to more violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.98,0:19:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, hold on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.54,0:20:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, whoa! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.18,0:20:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell do you think you're doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.36,0:20:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Children all across this small\Nworld of ours are on my side!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.58,0:20:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.60,0:20:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not how the\Nstory's supposed to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.12,0:20:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd weather go?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.28,0:20:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't afford to be separated\Nfrom him and my buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.42,0:20:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.33,0:20:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Please just wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.18,0:20:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.60,0:20:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who caused the accident\Nin the first place, so we're leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.54,0:20:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hold on. Please wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.98,0:20:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't hear you very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.34,0:20:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.60,0:20:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,As you see, I have quite a lot of\Nhair growing on my ears these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.88,0:20:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Come closer, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.56,0:20:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have time for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.08,0:20:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Just sit tight and wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.32,0:20:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure someone will show up\Nsoon and call you an ambulance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.76,0:20:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hurt your fingers, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.52,0:20:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Your nails are cracked.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.98,0:20:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.94,0:20:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I just have large hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.04,0:21:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,All the better for hugging you\Nwith is thanks for helping me
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.02,0:21:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, your pants are ripped\Nand something's coming out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.28,0:21:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.19,0:21:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,this is just a feather\Nduster Your pants must
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.40,0:21:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,have gotten pretty dirty\Nwhen you saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.74,0:21:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,How about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.65,0:21:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me dust them off for\Nyou Hey, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.18,0:21:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mouth is getting\Nfreakishly big That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.02,0:21:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,All the better to devour you\Nwith little red riding hood
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.94,0:21:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,DRIVE OR DRIVE!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.76,0:21:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This ending is just like this story.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.44,0:21:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.48,0:21:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he just say story?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.40,0:21:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.94,0:21:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a feeling that\NPinocchio, the dwarves,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.22,0:21:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,and the other characters\Naren't the actual stands.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.30,0:21:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The Stand user and their ability\Nexist elsewhere as separate entities,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.60,0:21:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,and they brought these beings to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.80,0:21:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Towards the north,\Nsomewhere not too far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.62,0:22:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the direction I sense\Nthe enemy's ability coming from.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.30,0:22:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Pinocchio was just the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.36,0:22:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The Stand user must be taken down.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.12,0:22:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.03,0:22:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you hear what I'm saying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.40,0:22:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I cope.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.88,0:22:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,My head is filled with hope
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.88,0:22:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Of some place other than here
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.62,0:22:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I smile
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.76,0:22:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside and all the while
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.16,0:23:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm wondering about my destiny
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.02,0:23:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.10,0:23:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,about Out all the
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.78,0:23:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,things I'd like
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.62,0:23:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,to do in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.52,0:23:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a dreamer,
